MY AVIATION CENTER OF EXCELLENCE.'}{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2023-04-04 13:00:00', 'title': 'HPE TRANSFORMS DATA LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT WITH EXPANDED HPE ALLETRA PORTFOLIO WITH NEW FILE, BLOCK AND DATA PROTECTION SERVICES', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW FILE, BLOCK, DISASTER AND BACKUP RECOVERY DATA SERVICES DESIGNED TO HELP CUSTOMERS ELIMINATE DATA SILOS, REDUCE COST AND COMPLEXITY, AND IMPROVE PERFORMANCE. THE NEW FILE STORAGE DATA SERVICES DELIVER SCALE-OUT, ENTERPRISE-GRADE PERFORMANCE FOR DATA-INTENSIVE WORKLOADS, AND THE EXPANDED BLOCK SERVICES PROVIDE MISSION-CRITICAL STORAGE WITH MID-RANGE ECONOMICS.'}{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2023-04-04 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION PLEDGES $10M+ TO IMPROVE ACCESSIBILITY, SUPPORT COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE COUNTRY IN 2023', 'text': "FINANCIAL COMMITMENT CELEBRATES 30TH ANNIVERSARY OF TEAM DEPOT, THE HOME DEPOT'S ASSOCIATE VOLUNTEER FORCE ATLANTA , APRIL 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION PLEDGED TO INVEST $10 MILLION IN COMMUNITY SERVICE PROJECTS THIS YEAR IN CELEBRATION OF THE 30-YEAR ANNIVERSARY OF THE HOME DEPOT'S ASSOCIATE VOLUNTEER FORCE, TEAM DEPOT. SINCE 2011, THE HOME DEPOT FOUNDATION HAS PARTNERED WITH MORE THAN 10,000 NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS, WITH TEAM DEPOT DONATING NEARLY 2 MILLION HOURS OF SWEAT EQUITY TO SERVE VETERANS, RESPOND TO NATURAL DISASTERS AND ADDRESS IMMEDIATE NEEDS WITHIN LOCAL NEIGHBORHOODS."}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2023-04-04 15:00:00', 'title': "HORMEL FOODS AGAIN NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST TRUSTWORTHY COMPANIES BY NEWSWEEK", 'text': "COMPANY RECEIVES HONOR FOR SECOND STRAIGHT YEAR AUSTIN, MINN. , APRIL 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A FORTUNE 500 GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, HAS BEEN NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST TRUSTWORTHY COMPANIES BY NEWSWEEK FOR A SECOND STRAIGHT YEAR."}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-04-04 09:01:00', 'title': 'VIRTUAL TECHNOLOGIES GROUP NAMES IT VETER