N & JOHNSON (NYSE:JNJ) (THE COMPANY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY LTL MANAGEMENT LLC (LTL) HAS RE-FILED FOR VOLUNTARY CHAPTER 11 BANKRUPTCY PROTECTION TO OBTAIN APPROVAL OF A REORGANIZATION PLAN THAT WILL EQUITABLY AND EFFICIENTLY RESOLVE ALL CLAIMS ARISING FROM COSMETIC TALC LITIGATION AGAINST THE COMPANY AND ITS AFFILIATES IN NORTH AMERICA. TO THAT END, THE COMPANY HAS AGREED TO CONTRIBUTE UP TO A PRESENT VALUE OF $8.'}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2023-04-04 12:33:00', 'title': 'BEASLEY ALLEN/ARNOLD & ITKIN LAW FIRMS: ON EVE OF J&J BANKRUPTCY DISMISSAL, CANCER VICTIMS PREPARE TO ENTER CIVIL COURT SYSTEM', 'text': "TRENTON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CANCER VICTIMS WHO ARE SEEKING TO HOLD JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) RESPONSIBLE AFTER BEING EXPOSED TO CANCER-CAUSING TALC IN ITS JOHNSON'S BABY POWDER WILL BE ASKING STATE COURTS AND THE JUDGE IN THE FEDERAL TALC MULTIDISTRICT LITIGATION TO IMMEDIATELY RESUME CIVIL COURT TRIALS. “THE BANKRUPTCY THAT WAS REJECTED BY THE U.S."}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2023-04-04 08:55:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS DEEPENS ITS COLLABORATION WITH THE INTERNATIONAL WELL BUILDING INSTITUTE AS AN ENTERPRISE PROVIDER TO DELIVER HEALTHY BUILDING SOLUTIONS', 'text': "WITH A GOAL OF SCALING HEALTH AND WELL-BEING EFFORTS EFFICIENTLY AND EFFECTIVELY, JOHNSON CONTROLS' DESIGNATION AS A WELL ENTERPRISE PROVIDER (EP) WILL HELP DRIVE A GLOBAL CULTURE OF HEALTH FOR EMPLOYEES, CUSTOMERS AND COMMUNITIES JOHNSON CONTROLS U.S. AND CHINA HEADQUARTERS RENEWED ITS WELL HEALTH-SAFETY RATING FOR FACILITY OPERATIONS AND MANAGEMENT BY THE INTERNATIONAL WELL BUILDING INSTITUTE MILWAUKEE , APRIL 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON CONTROLS \xa0(NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS INVESTED IN ITS COLLABORATION WITH THE INTERNATIONAL WELL BUILDING INSTITUTE (IWBI) TO STRENGTHEN ITS COMMITMENT TO HEALTHY BUILDING SOLUTIONS FOR BOTH ITS EMPLOYEES AND CUSTOMERS. JOHNSON CONTROLS INVESTS IN ITS COMMITMENT T